| `Range` | Optional. Return the bytes of the blob only in the specified range. |
| `x-ms-range` | Optional. Return the bytes of the blob only in the specified range. If both `Range` and `x-ms-range` are specified, the service uses the value of `x-ms-range`. If neither range is specified, the entire blob contents are returned. For more information, see [Specify the range header for Blob Storage operations](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/rest/api/storageservices/specifying-the-range-header-for-blob-service-operations). |
